{
  "answer": "SARA Title III - Section 311/312 -Hazard Categories: Shipping Information: No - Fire Hazard FOR CONTAINERS > Cleaning Compound Identification System No - Sudden Release of Pressure Hazard Health No - Reactivity Hazard FOR 1 GALLON CONTAINERS: Cleaning Compound Flammability Yes - Immediate (acute) Health Hazard Reactivity No - Delayed (chronic) Health Hazard FOR CONTAINERS < 1 GALLON: Cleaning Compound",
  "source": "SARA Title III - Section 311/312, SECTION 6-STORAGE AND HANDLING INFORMATION"
}

