  "answer": "The product contains Water (to 100%), 2-Butoxyethanol (0 to 5%), Potassium Alkyl Aryl Sulfonate (0 to 5%), Potassium Tall Oil Soap (0 to 5%), Sodium Tripolyphosphate (0 to 5%), Dye (<1%), and Fragrance (<1%).",
  "source": "SECTION 2-INGREDIENT INFORMATION"
}

{
  "answer": "No known hazardous reactions or incompatibilities with other substances or materials are mentioned in the SDS.",
  "source": "SECTION 6-STORAGE AND HANDLING INFORMATION, SECTION 9-SPILL OR LEAK PROCEDURES"
}

